# OpenAgent — Change Log

## 0.1.1 — 2026-10-18
- Added root-level `TODO`, `PROFILE`, `CHANGES`, and `.gitignore`.
- Fixed Windows PowerShell environment activation/setup instructions.
- Lowered Python requirement from 3.11+ to 3.10+ (the code uses compatible syntax).
- Made development dependency resolution consistent: `pytest>=8.2,<10`,
  `pytest-asyncio>=1.3,<2`, and `httpx>=0.27,<1`.
- Updated package and API/health version to 0.1.1.
- Added a regression test for the package/health version.

## 0.1.0 — 2026-10-18
- Initial FastAPI-compatible bridge with provider registry and mock provider.
- Introduced capability manifests, OAP/1 validation, and a SQLite session journal.
- Added basic SSE completion response and tests.

## Known limitations
- No live browser adapter and no provider-native streaming.
- PyPI installation resolution on Windows/Python 3.10 needs user-side validation.
